CONTENT cand=T0050 ovl=2 interp=SUP text="Hot air rises because it is less dense than cold air. "
CONTENT cand=T0070 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="The small intestine is about 20 feet long in adults. "
CONTENT cand=T0077 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="The sky looks blue because air scatters blue sunlight more than other colors. "
CONTENT cand=T0081 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="Hair grows about half an inch per month on average. "
CONTENT cand=T0118 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="I feel that autumn air smells like possibility. "
CONTENT cand=T0130 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="The Eiffel Tower grows about 15 centimeters taller in the summer heat. "
CONTENT cand=T0143 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="Babies are born with about 300 bones, which fuse into 206 by adulthood. "
CONTENT cand=T0150 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="The Bering Strait separates Russia from Alaska by about 85 kilometers. "
CONTENT cand=T0160 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="The Sahara was green and fertile about 6,000 years ago. "
CONTENT cand=T0167 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="Sushi is overrated and mostly about the atmosphere. "
CONTENT cand=T0196 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="Breathing helium makes voices squeaky because the gas is much less dense than air. "
CONTENT cand=T0247 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="The Dead Sea is so salty that people float effortlessly in it. "
CONTENT cand=T0261 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="Fingernails grow about four times faster than toenails. "
CONTENT cand=T0276 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="The universe is about 100 billion years old. "
CONTENT cand=T0342 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="Your body produces about 25 million new cells every second. "
CONTENT cand=T0384 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="Sound travels faster in air than in water. "
VERDICT id=T0044 verdict=FACT
